{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dear Marie,\n\nI have had a long journey behind me today. The weather was wonderful, and I reached The Hague only after 8 o'clock in the evening. It is the furthest point of my journey, from where I will return tomorrow.\n\nThe landscape was very pleasant: many green meadows and numerous ships sailing on the water. It was a peaceful, wide area. I have not yet fully shaken off the fatigue of the trip, but the seclusion does good. Tomorrow morning I will still see the North Sea before I set out on the journey home.\n\nI think of you and of our apartment in Berlin. Please tell Karl and Immanuel that I have arrived safely.\n\nYour faithful\nGeorg"}}],"created":1795221056,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":148,"prompt_tokens":230,"total_tokens":378,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-y7xEGFzFtnqX6VbNMEMLYBdA9ayQSXoh","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":230,"prompt_ms":376.621,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.637482608695652,"prompt_per_second":610.6935088590387,"predicted_n":148,"predicted_ms":3439.668,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.399102040816327,"predicted_per_second":42.73668272635615}}